"rank":1191,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":3}}],"members":[],"member_of":[{"id":237555277288620,"type":"artist","name":"Disney Channel","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":1,"yt":null,"src":"ensayos"}],"genres":[],"album_genres":[{"id":102845406900443,"type":"genre","name":"Pop Punk","n":2},{"id":185670346256268,"type":"genre","name":"rock","n":1},{"id":180142577009784,"type":"genre","name":"ballad","n":1},{"id":121661734395550,"type":"genre","name":"Power Pop","n":1},{"id":100106212412601,"type":"genre","name":"Teen Pop","n":1},{"id":32992220995517,"type":"genre","name":"Grunge","n":1},{"id":30277598324326,"type":"genre","name":"pop","n":1},{"id":18872195504512,"type":"genre","name":"Pop Rock","n":1}],"labels":[],"album_labels":[],"own_scenes":[],"scenes":[],"book_tracks":[],"mentions":[],"podcast":[{"kind":"podcast","title":"Strong Contender for 2024 Grammys","body":"Olivia Rodrigo was highlighted as a strong contender for Album of the Year at the 2024 Grammys, fulfilling cultural impact and youth guidelines as she is only 20. The only small strike against her was a prior win for Best New Artist. \"I would also strongly consider Olivia Rodrigo, who certainly fulfills my cultural impact and youth guidelines. She's only 20.\"","year":2024,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Hit Parade Music History and Music Trivia","episode":"And the Grammy Goes to… Edition Part 2","url":null},{"source":"Hit Parade Music History and Music Trivia","episode":"And the Grammy Goes to… Edition Part 2","url":"https://shows.acast.com/hit-parade/episodes/695d4eef154465cd600c4ddc"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":"10+ Tracks Charting Simultaneously","body":"Olivia Rodrigo is cited as one of the \"millennial or zoomer\" artists who have placed ten or more songs on the Hot 100 simultaneously in the digital era, indicative of an imperial moment. \"Billie Eilish to Olivia Rodrigo.\"","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Hit Parade Music History and Music Trivia","episode":"Material Girl in an Imperial World Edition Part 1","url":null},{"source":"Hit Parade Music History and Music Trivia","episode":"Material Girl in an Imperial World Edition Part 1","url":"https://shows.acast.com/hit-parade/episodes/695d4f03154465cd600c5379"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":"Best New Artist Winner","body":"Olivia Rodrigo previously won the Best New Artist Grammy two years prior to the 2024 awards season, a minor point against her in the \"avoid repeat winners\" guideline for top categories. \"About the only small strike against Rodrigo is she already won Best New Artist two years ago.\"","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Hit Parade Music History and Music Trivia","episode":"And the Grammy Goes to… Edition Part 2","url":null},{"source":"Hit Parade Music History and Music Trivia","episode":"And the Grammy Goes to… Edition Part 2","url":"https://shows.acast.com/hit-parade/episodes/695d4eef154465cd600c4ddc"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":"Disney Channel Background","body":"Before 2021, Olivia Rodrigo was primarily known for her acting role on the Disney Channel series \"High School Musical: The Musical: The Series.\" She was an \"up-and-coming Disney kid\" following a path similar to Miley Cyrus and Ariana Grande, who also transitioned from Disney to solo music careers. \"Before 2021, the musician Olivia Rodrigo was best known for appearing on the Disney Channel.\"","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Hit Parade Music History and Music Trivia","episode":"Decoder Ring - The New Age Hit Machine","url":null},{"source":"Hit Parade Music History and Music Trivia","episode":"Decoder Ring - The New Age Hit Machine","url":"https://shows.acast.com/hit-parade/episodes/695d4ee88e6dd12efb02c1d2"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":"Loyal Fanbase Driving #1 Debuts","body":"Olivia Rodrigo, a \"rock-leaning pop starlet,\" has a loyal fanbase that has successfully launched several of her hits at number one. This demonstrates the power of dedicated fan armies in the streaming era to propel an artist's songs to the top of the charts. \"the rock-leaning pop starlet Olivia Rodrigo whose loyal fanbase has launched several of her hits at number 1.\"","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Hit Parade Music History and Music Trivia","episode":"Toppermost of the Poppermost Edition Part 1","url":null},{"source":"Hit Parade Music History and Music Trivia","episode":"Toppermost of the Poppermost Edition Part 1","url":"https://shows.acast.com/hit-parade/episodes/695d4ef60c30a1408dc29358"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":"Smartphone Video Production","body":"Olivia Rodrigo has shot music videos using smartphones, demonstrating how this technology has become commonplace for artists, including major stars. This approach reflects a shift in production values, where conceptual creativity can thrive without the need for extensive budgets and traditional high-end equipment. \"Artists biggest Lady Gaga and Olivia Rodrigo have shot videos this way.\"","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"The Ongoing History of New Music","episode":"The Rise and Fall and Future of the Music Video - Part 2","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7IDbqdIw3WU"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":"TikTok Virality","body":"Her debut single, \"Driver's License,\" became \"inescapable on TikTok\" due to a combination of its catchy nature and widespread speculation about the real-life love triangle among Disney actors hinted at in the lyrics. This platform's ability to drive interest and listenership propelled the song to rapid chart success. \"Basically, this is the perfect storm for TikTok.\"","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Hit Parade Music History and Music Trivia","episode":"Decoder Ring - The New Age Hit Machine","url":null},{"source":"Hit Parade Music History and Music Trivia","episode":"Decoder Ring - The New Age Hit Machine","url":"https://shows.acast.com/hit-parade/episodes/695d4ee88e6dd12efb02c1d2"}]}],"awards":[{"kind":"award","title":"American Music Award for Artist of the Y