1027904"}]}],"concerts":[],"xref":[{"kind":"xref","title":"Diverse Fanbase","body":"Her fanbase is wide-ranging, including prominent figures like Billie Eilish, Ed Sheeran, Charlie XCX, Willow Smith, and Olivia Rodrigo. Even Rob Halford of the metal band Judas Priest openly expresses his admiration for Avril Lavigne. \"Fans include Billy Eilish, Ed Sheeran, Charlie XCX, Willow Smith and Olivia Rodrigo, even Rob Hulford of Judas Priest says he's a fan of Avril Lavigne.\"","year":null,"extra":{"from":"Avril Lavigne","from_id":111077490160587,"type":"curiosity"},"srcs":[{"source":"The Ongoing History of New Music","episode":"Driven By Her: Women of the 21st Century","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=11UsTJQyQds"}]},{"kind":"xref","title":"Smartphone Video Production","body":"Lady Gaga is one of the major artists who has embraced the use of smartphones to shoot her music videos. This trend highlights the dramatic drop in production costs and the accessibility of high-quality consumer-grade gear, allowing for creative freedom outside of large budgets. \"Artists biggest Lady Gaga and Olivia Rodrigo have shot videos this way.\"","year":null,"extra":{"from":"Lady Gaga","from_id":213301221895807,"type":"curiosity"},"srcs":[{"source":"The Ongoing History of New Music","episode":"The Rise and Fall and Future of the Music Video - Part 2","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7IDbqdIw3WU"}]}],"charts":[{"id":181635921682756,"type":"song","name":"Drivers License","work_year":2021,"list_id":184225487175112,"list":"Billboard Hot 100 nº1 · 2020s","src":"singles","rank":1116,"year":2021,"note":"8 semanas","yt":"ZmDBbnmKpqQ","scaruffi":null},{"id":113002363135814,"type":"song","name":"Good 4 U","work_year":2021,"list_id":184225487175112,"list":"Billboard Hot 100 nº1 · 2020s","src":"singles","rank":1124,"year":2021,"note":"1 semanas","yt":"gNi_6U5Pm_o","scaruffi":null},{"id":113002363135814,"type":"song","name":"Good 4 U","work_year":2021,"list_id":34094536844044,"list":"Billboar